      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Strong – The phased development approach (prototypes, testing, certification) demonstrates a methodical and realistic plan.  Dust pickup results are a good starting point.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Good – Module sales, replacement parts, and potential subscription services (e.g., extended warranty, filter refills) create a sustainable model. The circular service is a strong element.",
      "Differentiation": "• Moderate – The modular design and UVC disinfection are differentiating factors. However, the cordless stick vacuum market is competitive.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Moderate – The dust pickup results provide some evidence of performance. The diagnostic alerts and predictive maintenance add value.  The focus on reducing e-waste is a positive impact.",
